{cu'i}.

Yes, I believe you also used that correctly.  I think that ALSO works
similarly for BAI.  {mi citka mu'icu'i lo nu mi xagji} = "I eat without
motivational influence of I am hungry" (i.e. whether I am hungry or not has
no influence over the fact that I eat).

